From fb9213191bd006fa956e1c2a419b3e8144d347be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:42:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Difficulty pass 3: hand-built boss teams for Johto and the
 League

tools/hack/boss_teams.py rebuilds the eight Johto Gym Leaders, the
rival's battles up to Victory Road, the Team Rocket executives, the
Kimono Girls, the Elite Four and Lance. Teams lead with Johto Pokemon,
grow from three to six, and every Pokemon has a held item and a moveset
checked against what it can learn at its level. From Chuck on they
also have natures and EV spreads.
---
